{
  "epId": 2960,
  "name": "赤沙石板",
  "desc": "<p>教令院学者提尔扎德多年来的研究对象，从纹样与工艺来看是赤王文明的造物。似乎隐藏着催动赤王遗迹机关的权能…</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/05/326985891/2b53e6df68fddc3e675b83ad7339db61_6985362077636497162.png",
  "menuId": 9,
  "menuName": "提瓦特物产",
  "version": 1776048724,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "教程"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/05/237301566/00191cdb81859f52a3ed171bb72ae4e2_2735021401716101614.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "被激活的赤沙石版拥有特殊的「权能」，似乎可以凭借这种权能操控赤王遗迹中的各种机关。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/05/237301566/d06d83b0ec8960c4f57301ea63c5a2a8_7912368619813356394.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "随着冒险的深入，赤沙石版会逐步揭示遗迹中重要地点的位置。跟随石板的指引前进，并使用特殊的「权能」解开机关，也许能够到达前人未曾踏足之地。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "权能等阶"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/7b304dcdc6606ec585093ee5640014f4_1804116639320835128.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "渡厄厅\n拜谒了圣显厅后，赤沙石板获得了前往赤王陵地下渡厄厅的权能，依照指引，前往尚未被冒险家与学者踏足之地吧。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/52bff82cb95860509ccd26cd7ea6896e_3347420778779018513.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "圣显厅\n根据祝祭厅的地图指示得知的「赤王的智慧」隐匿之处。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/f08ee40a160d8504b1748113d0fcfca5_7282827684102387821.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "大赤沙海\n获得了赤沙石板的所有权能之后，大赤沙海中每一间宫室都将开启门扉，不再将秘密与宝藏隐藏。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/cef58bd4b6b165a586e34ed820f17644_4738003621496945418.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "本相元件\n赤王遗迹中有许多事物被神秘的力量隐藏了本来面目。这时就需要借助本相元件的力量。\n持有特殊的权能时，使用本相元件，可以在一段时间内，让周围透明的事物重新显现。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/2ab8afa23fb5c09bbec7e43597c101fe_6562682565904109228.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "隐视元件\n赤王遗迹中的神秘机关。持有特殊的权能后靠近，可以使用它将附近的墙壁变为透明的幻影，以便元能光束通过。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/4db17087f5948a6d91e552261cddb5cf_6487167422654855768.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "巨大扇叶\n会吹出强风的巨大扇叶，阻挡前进的步伐，吹飞元能火种。想要通过的话，需要耐心等待扇叶停止运转的时机，或是找寻能让它们停止运转的机关…",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/907e5d9b4f4ae7df46ad58b819f86b68_3022265676855716021.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/b1aec96c95f8f9f81b40fbe9cd4f36aa_839663071366452506.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "恒光元件\n被称为「恒光元件」的赤王遗迹机关，会发射元能光束。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "持有特殊的权能并靠近后，可以改变恒光元件的位置或朝向。"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「噬光元件」是元能光束的接收机关。当恒光元件发射的元能光束链接至噬光元件时，也许会有特殊的事情发生…有时，元能光束会被遗迹内的墙壁阻断，也许需要 <color=#ffe04b>操作其他机关</color> ，让光束能够顺利穿过墙壁…",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/54e857c3ee988ced1a7578587a0123cc_4097065182704113997.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "元能屏障\n阻拦外来者的能量屏障，如果持有特殊的权能的话，应该能够顺利通过…",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/b37f7d2c3852693abee9b8abc5b1c3ee_1493501211642049524.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/04/237301566/373456423383e177e7af43a4e2fe471b_8839135478272749820.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "秘仪台座\n在赤王遗迹中，存在这种被称作 <color=#ffe04b>「秘仪台座」</color> 的装置。可以通过它们操纵遗迹中的各种机关。\n但是，想要使用秘仪台座，似乎需要持有 <color=#ffe04b>特殊的权能</color> 。",
        "alignment": "center"
      }
    ],
